window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a427-f6cf8602d32382b6.json"]={sha256:"f6cf8602d32382b6281cd3642aa65d7106a79d2088b1b09419c93e6cfb037fe9",value:{"id":"a427","title":"雙光子顯微鏡","titleEn":"Two-photon microscopy","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從雙光子吸收率與強度平方成正比出發，理解為何飛秒脈衝、高數值孔徑與非去掃描偵測能在散射組織深處取得固有光學切片，再把脈衝展寬、散射長度、功率與熱負載、點擴散函數校正和共振掃描時序整合成可驗收的雙光子成像系統。","summaryEn":"Start from the quadratic intensity dependence of two-photon absorption to see why femtosecond pulses, high numerical aperture and non-descanned detection give intrinsic optical sections deep in scattering tissue, then integrate pulse broadening, scattering length, power and heat load, point-spread calibration and resonant-scan timing into an acceptable two-photon imaging system.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-microscopy","subcategoryTitle":"先進顯微與光學影像","subcategoryTitleEn":"Advanced microscopy and optical imaging","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-microscopy","learningTags":["optics","optics-microscopy","microscope"],"architectureFamily":"microscope","architectureNodes":[["飛秒鈦藍寶石／光纖雷射","Femtosecond Ti:sapphire or fibre laser"],["色散預補償與 Pockels 功率控制","Dispersion precompensation and Pockels power control"],["振鏡與共振掃描器","Galvanometer and resonant scanners"],["高數值孔徑低倍水浸物鏡","High-NA low-magnification water objective"],["非去掃描 GaAsP 偵測","Non-descanned GaAsP detection"],["影像重建與深度疊層","Image reconstruction and depth stack"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"microscope","labels":["飛秒鈦藍寶石／光纖雷射","色散預補償與 Pockels 功率控制","振鏡與共振掃描器","高數值孔徑低倍水浸物鏡","非去掃描 GaAsP 偵測"],"labelsEn":["Femtosecond Ti:sapphire or fibre laser","Dispersion precompensation and Pockels power control","Galvanometer and resonant scanners","High-NA low-magnification water objective","Non-descanned GaAsP detection"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"深度與色散練習：920 nm、80 MHz、樣品面 15 mW、NA 1.0 水鏡、δ = 30 GM。由單元一的公式，10 mW 時 n_a ≈ 0.14，15 mW 時按 P² 放大為 0.14×2.25 ≈ 0.31 光子對/分子/脈衝。若顯微鏡 5000 fs² 的色散未補償，脈衝從 100 fs 展寬到 171 fs，n_a 降為 0.31×100/171 ≈ 0.18。在 400 µm 深處、l_s = 200 µm，到達焦點的彈道功率只有 15×e⁻² ≈ 2.0 mW，n_a 再乘 (2.0/15)² ≈ 0.018 變成 0.0033，訊號幾乎消失。要在 400 µm 回到 0.31，需先做預補償，再把表面功率提高到 15×e² ≈ 111 mW，依每 100 mW 約 1.8 K 估計溫升約 2 K；若改用 1300 nm、l_s = 350 µm，所需功率為 15×e^(400/350) ≈ 47 mW，溫升不到 1 K，但水的吸收較高且可用螢光蛋白受限。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Depth and dispersion exercise: 920 nm, 80 MHz, 15 mW at the sample, NA 1.0 water objective, δ = 30 GM. From the unit-one formula n_a ≈ 0.14 at 10 mW, so at 15 mW it scales with P² to 0.14×2.25 ≈ 0.31 photon pairs per molecule per pulse. If the microscope's 5000 fs² of dispersion is uncompensated the pulse stretches from 100 to 171 fs and n_a falls to 0.31×100/171 ≈ 0.18. At 400 µm depth with l_s = 200 µm only 15×e⁻² ≈ 2.0 mW of ballistic power reaches the focus, so n_a is multiplied by (2.0/15)² ≈ 0.018 and becomes 0.0033, nearly no signal. To recover 0.31 at 400 µm, first precompensate, then raise the surface power to 15×e² ≈ 111 mW, with a heating estimate of about 2 K at 1.8 K per 100 mW; switching to 1300 nm with l_s = 350 µm needs only 15×e^(400/350) ≈ 47 mW and under 1 K of heating, but water absorption is higher and fewer fluorescent proteins are usable. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a427-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「雙光子吸收與固有光學切片」與「散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning\" and \"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a427-v12-01","title":"雙光子吸收與固有光學切片：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “I² excitation volume at the focus” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"雙光子激發要求兩個近紅外光子在飛秒內同時被同一分子吸收，速率正比於強度平方 I²，所以只有焦點附近強度最高的微小體積才有效發光；離焦平面的總激發量隨離焦距離以 1/z² 衰減，不需要針孔就能切片。要把平均功率不高的光做到足夠的瞬時強度，必須用鎖模雷射把能量壓縮成約 100 fs 的脈衝，並以約 80 MHz 重複；在固定平均功率下，脈衝越短、重複率越低，每個脈衝的激發機率越高。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Two-photon excitation needs two near-infrared photons absorbed by the same molecule within femtoseconds, at a rate proportional to the squared intensity I², so only the tiny volume of highest intensity around the focus emits efficiently; the total excitation in out-of-focus planes falls as 1/z² with defocus, giving sectioning without a pinhole. To reach sufficient instantaneous intensity from modest average power, a mode-locked laser compresses the energy into pulses of about 100 fs repeated at about 80 MHz; at fixed average power, shorter pulses and lower repetition rate raise the excitation probability per pulse. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “I² excitation volume at the focus”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：每脈衝每分子吸收的光子對數 n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Photon pairs absorbed per molecule per pulse: n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]².","failure":"常見誤解：「雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “I² excitation volume at the focus”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-01-k1","title":"雙光子吸收與固有光學切片","titleEn":"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning","text":"雙光子激發要求兩個近紅外光子在飛秒內同時被同一分子吸收，速率正比於強度平方 I²，所以只有焦點附近強度最高的微小體積才有效發光；離焦平面的總激發量隨離焦距離以 1/z² 衰減，不需要針孔就能切片。要把平均功率不高的光做到足夠的瞬時強度，必須用鎖模雷射把能量壓縮成約 100 fs 的脈衝，並以約 80 MHz 重複；在固定平均功率下，脈衝越短、重複率越低，每個脈衝的激發機率越高。","textEn":"Two-photon excitation needs two near-infrared photons absorbed by the same molecule within femtoseconds, at a rate proportional to the squared intensity I², so only the tiny volume of highest intensity around the focus emits efficiently; the total excitation in out-of-focus planes falls as 1/z² with defocus, giving sectioning without a pinhole. To reach sufficient instantaneous intensity from modest average power, a mode-locked laser compresses the energy into pulses of about 100 fs repeated at about 80 MHz; at fixed average power, shorter pulses and lower repetition rate raise the excitation probability per pulse.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雙光子吸收與固有光學切片」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning\" is correct?","options":["雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","雙光子激發要求兩個近紅外光子在飛秒內同時被同一分子吸收，速率正比於強度平方 I²，所以只有焦點附近強度最高的微小體積才有效發光。","只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。"],"optionsEn":["A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","Two-photon excitation needs two near-infrared photons absorbed by the same molecule within femtoseconds, at a rate proportional to the squared intensity I², so only the tiny volume of highest intensity around the focus emits efficiently.","With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"雙光子激發要求兩個近紅外光子在飛秒內同時被同一分子吸收，速率正比於強度平方 I²，所以只有焦點附近強度最高的微小體積才有效發光；離焦平面的總激發量隨離焦距離以 1/z² 衰減，不需要針孔就能切片。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Two-photon excitation needs two near-infrared photons absorbed by the same molecule within femtoseconds, at a rate proportional to the squared intensity I², so only the tiny volume of highest intensity around the focus emits efficiently; the total excitation in out-of-focus planes falls as 1/z² with defocus, giving sectioning without a pinhole. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a427-v12-02","title":"雙光子吸收與固有光學切片：定量估算","titleEn":"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “I² excitation volume at the focus” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：每脈衝每分子吸收的光子對數 n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²。取 δ = 30 GM（3×10⁻⁵⁷ m⁴·s）、P = 10 mW、τ = 100 fs、f = 80 MHz、NA = 1.0、λ = 920 nm：P²/(τf²) ≈ 1.56×10⁻⁷ J²/s，[NA²/(2ħcλ)]² ≈ 2.96×10⁶² J⁻²m⁻⁴，n_a ≈ 0.14。發射率 ≈ n_a·f·Φ ≈ 0.14×8×10⁷×0.8 ≈ 9×10⁶ 光子/s；脈衝縮短一半或重複率減半，n_a 都加倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Photon pairs absorbed per molecule per pulse: n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]². With δ = 30 GM (3×10⁻⁵⁷ m⁴·s), P = 10 mW, τ = 100 fs, f = 80 MHz, NA = 1.0 and λ = 920 nm: P²/(τf²) ≈ 1.56×10⁻⁷ J²/s, [NA²/(2ħcλ)]² ≈ 2.96×10⁶² J⁻²m⁻⁴, so n_a ≈ 0.14. The emission rate ≈ n_a·f·Φ ≈ 0.14×8×10⁷×0.8 ≈ 9×10⁶ photons/s; halving the pulse width or the repetition rate doubles n_a. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在均勻螢光素溶液中量螢光對雷射功率的對數斜率，應接近 2；再用自相關儀改變脈衝寬度（例如以預啁啾量調整），確認同功率下螢光與 1/τ 成正比，兩項結果一起證明激發是雙光子過程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the log-log slope of fluorescence against laser power in a uniform fluorescein solution, which should be close to 2; then vary the pulse width with the autocorrelator as reference (for example through the prechirp setting) and confirm that fluorescence at constant power scales as 1/τ, which together prove a two-photon process.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"每脈衝每分子吸收的光子對數 n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²。取 δ = 30 GM（3×10⁻⁵⁷ m⁴·s）、P = 10 mW、τ = 100 fs、f = 80 MHz、NA = 1.0、λ = 920 nm：P²/(τf²) ≈ 1.56×10⁻⁷ J²/s，[NA²/(2ħcλ)]² ≈ 2.96×10⁶² J⁻²m⁻⁴，n_a ≈ 0.14。發射率 ≈ n_a·f·Φ ≈ 0.14×8×10⁷×0.8 ≈ 9×10⁶ 光子/s；脈衝縮短一半或重複率減半，n_a 都加倍。","textEn":"Photon pairs absorbed per molecule per pulse: n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]². With δ = 30 GM (3×10⁻⁵⁷ m⁴·s), P = 10 mW, τ = 100 fs, f = 80 MHz, NA = 1.0 and λ = 920 nm: P²/(τf²) ≈ 1.56×10⁻⁷ J²/s, [NA²/(2ħcλ)]² ≈ 2.96×10⁶² J⁻²m⁻⁴, so n_a ≈ 0.14. The emission rate ≈ n_a·f·Φ ≈ 0.14×8×10⁷×0.8 ≈ 9×10⁶ photons/s; halving the pulse width or the repetition rate doubles n_a.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雙光子吸收與固有光學切片」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning\", which statement holds?","options":["偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。","提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。","每脈衝每分子吸收的光子對數 n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²。"],"optionsEn":["Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.","Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.","Photon pairs absorbed per molecule per pulse: n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每脈衝每分子吸收的光子對數 n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Photon pairs absorbed per molecule per pulse: n_a ≈ δ·P²/(τ·f²)·[NA²/(2ħcλ)]². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a427-v12-03","title":"雙光子吸收與固有光學切片：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “I² excitation volume at the focus” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在均勻螢光素溶液中量螢光對雷射功率的對數斜率，應接近 2；再用自相關儀改變脈衝寬度（例如以預啁啾量調整），確認同功率下螢光與 1/τ 成正比，兩項結果一起證明激發是雙光子過程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the log-log slope of fluorescence against laser power in a uniform fluorescein solution, which should be close to 2; then vary the pulse width with the autocorrelator as reference (for example through the prechirp setting) and confirm that fluorescence at constant power scales as 1/τ, which together prove a two-photon process. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：功率推到每脈衝接近一個光子對時激發飽和，斜率從 2 降到 1 以下，點擴散函數變寬、切片變厚，且焦點處的高階吸收造成不可逆損傷。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Driving power until each pulse yields nearly one photon pair saturates the excitation, the slope drops from 2 to below 1, the point-spread function broadens, sectioning thickens, and higher-order absorption at the focus causes irreversible damage.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在均勻螢光素溶液中量螢光對雷射功率的對數斜率，應接近 2；再用自相關儀改變脈衝寬度（例如以預啁啾量調整），確認同功率下螢光與 1/τ 成正比，兩項結果一起證明激發是雙光子過程。","textEn":"Measure the log-log slope of fluorescence against laser power in a uniform fluorescein solution, which should be close to 2; then vary the pulse width with the autocorrelator as reference (for example through the prechirp setting) and confirm that fluorescence at constant power scales as 1/τ, which together prove a two-photon process.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雙光子吸收與固有光學切片」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning\"?","options":["在均勻螢光素溶液中量螢光對雷射功率的對數斜率，應接近 2。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the log-log slope of fluorescence against laser power in a uniform fluorescein solution, which should be close to 2.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在均勻螢光素溶液中量螢光對雷射功率的對數斜率，應接近 2；再用自相關儀改變脈衝寬度（例如以預啁啾量調整），確認同功率下螢光與 1/τ 成正比，兩項結果一起證明激發是雙光子過程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the log-log slope of fluorescence against laser power in a uniform fluorescein solution, which should be close to 2; then vary the pulse width with the autocorrelator as reference (for example through the prechirp setting) and confirm that fluorescence at constant power scales as 1/τ, which together prove a two-photon process. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a427-v12-04","title":"雙光子吸收與固有光學切片：失效診斷","titleEn":"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「焦點處的 I² 激發體積」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “I² excitation volume at the focus” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"功率推到每脈衝接近一個光子對時激發飽和，斜率從 2 降到 1 以下，點擴散函數變寬、切片變厚，且焦點處的高階吸收造成不可逆損傷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Driving power until each pulse yields nearly one photon pair saturates the excitation, the slope drops from 2 to below 1, the point-spread function broadens, sectioning thickens, and higher-order absorption at the focus causes irreversible damage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：要把平均功率不高的光做到足夠的瞬時強度，必須用鎖模雷射把能量壓縮成約 100 fs 的脈衝，並以約 80 MHz 重複；在固定平均功率下，脈衝越短、重複率越低，每個脈衝的激發機率越高。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: To reach sufficient instantaneous intensity from modest average power, a mode-locked laser compresses the energy into pulses of about 100 fs repeated at about 80 MHz; at fixed average power, shorter pulses and lower repetition rate raise the excitation probability per pulse.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"功率推到每脈衝接近一個光子對時激發飽和，斜率從 2 降到 1 以下，點擴散函數變寬、切片變厚，且焦點處的高階吸收造成不可逆損傷。","textEn":"Driving power until each pulse yields nearly one photon pair saturates the excitation, the slope drops from 2 to below 1, the point-spread function broadens, sectioning thickens, and higher-order absorption at the focus causes irreversible damage.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雙光子吸收與固有光學切片」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Two-photon absorption and intrinsic optical sectioning\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","功率推到每脈衝接近一個光子對時激發飽和，斜率從 2 降到 1 以下，點擴散函數變寬、切片變厚，且焦點處的高階吸收造成不可逆損傷。","只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Driving power until each pulse yields nearly one photon pair saturates the excitation, the slope drops from 2 to below 1, the point-spread function broadens, sectioning thickens, and higher-order absorption at the focus causes irreversible damage.","With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"功率推到每脈衝接近一個光子對時激發飽和，斜率從 2 降到 1 以下，點擴散函數變寬、切片變厚，且焦點處的高階吸收造成不可逆損傷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Driving power until each pulse yields nearly one photon pair saturates the excitation, the slope drops from 2 to below 1, the point-spread function broadens, sectioning thickens, and higher-order absorption at the focus causes irreversible damage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a427-v12-05","title":"散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「散射組織中的彈道光子」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"激發只靠到達焦點的彈道光子，而彈道功率隨深度按 exp(−z/l_s) 衰減，雙光子訊號因此按 exp(−2z/l_s) 下降；要維持訊號必須讓表面功率隨深度指數上升。近紅外波長越長散射越弱，920 nm 在腦皮質的散射長度約 200 µm，1300 nm 約 350 µm，所以長波長能以更少功率到達同樣深度，代價是水的吸收上升與可用的螢光蛋白較少。當表面附近的離焦雙光子背景與焦點訊號相當時，就到達成像深度極限。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「散射組織中的彈道光子」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Excitation relies only on ballistic photons reaching the focus, and ballistic power decays with depth as exp(−z/l_s), so the two-photon signal falls as exp(−2z/l_s); keeping signal constant requires surface power to rise exponentially with depth. Longer near-infrared wavelengths scatter less: in cortex the scattering length is about 200 µm at 920 nm and about 350 µm at 1300 nm, so the longer wavelength reaches the same depth with less power, at the cost of higher water absorption and fewer suitable fluorescent proteins. The depth limit is reached when out-of-focus two-photon background near the surface equals the focal signal. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：維持焦點激發不變所需的表面功率 P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Surface power needed to hold focal excitation constant is P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「散射組織中的彈道光子」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-05-k1","title":"散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇","titleEn":"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice","text":"激發只靠到達焦點的彈道光子，而彈道功率隨深度按 exp(−z/l_s) 衰減，雙光子訊號因此按 exp(−2z/l_s) 下降；要維持訊號必須讓表面功率隨深度指數上升。近紅外波長越長散射越弱，920 nm 在腦皮質的散射長度約 200 µm，1300 nm 約 350 µm，所以長波長能以更少功率到達同樣深度，代價是水的吸收上升與可用的螢光蛋白較少。","textEn":"Excitation relies only on ballistic photons reaching the focus, and ballistic power decays with depth as exp(−z/l_s), so the two-photon signal falls as exp(−2z/l_s); keeping signal constant requires surface power to rise exponentially with depth. Longer near-infrared wavelengths scatter less: in cortex the scattering length is about 200 µm at 920 nm and about 350 µm at 1300 nm, so the longer wavelength reaches the same depth with less power, at the cost of higher water absorption and fewer suitable fluorescent proteins.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice\" is correct?","options":["只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。","激發只靠到達焦點的彈道光子，而彈道功率隨深度按 exp(−z/l_s) 衰減，雙光子訊號因此按 exp(−2z/l_s) 下降。"],"optionsEn":["With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth.","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.","Excitation relies only on ballistic photons reaching the focus, and ballistic power decays with depth as exp(−z/l_s), so the two-photon signal falls as exp(−2z/l_s)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"激發只靠到達焦點的彈道光子，而彈道功率隨深度按 exp(−z/l_s) 衰減，雙光子訊號因此按 exp(−2z/l_s) 下降；要維持訊號必須讓表面功率隨深度指數上升。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Excitation relies only on ballistic photons reaching the focus, and ballistic power decays with depth as exp(−z/l_s), so the two-photon signal falls as exp(−2z/l_s); keeping signal constant requires surface power to rise exponentially with depth. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a427-v12-06","title":"散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇：定量估算","titleEn":"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「散射組織中的彈道光子」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：維持焦點激發不變所需的表面功率 P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s)。P₀ = 10 mW、l_s = 200 µm 時 600 µm 深需 10×e³ ≈ 201 mW；改用 1300 nm、l_s = 350 µm 只需 10×e^(600/350) ≈ 56 mW。文獻報導腦組織的穩態溫升約為每 100 mW 平均功率 1 到 2 K，因此 200 mW 已接近熱安全邊界。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Surface power needed to hold focal excitation constant is P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s). With P₀ = 10 mW and l_s = 200 µm, a depth of 600 µm needs 10×e³ ≈ 201 mW; at 1300 nm with l_s = 350 µm only 10×e^(600/350) ≈ 56 mW. Reported steady-state heating of brain tissue is about 1 to 2 K per 100 mW of average power, so 200 mW already approaches the thermal safety boundary. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在含 1% 脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體中埋入螢光珠，量各深度維持相同珠子亮度所需的功率，對深度取對數擬合出 l_s，與文獻值比較；再用插入式熱電偶或溫敏染料確認長時間掃描時的溫升。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Embed fluorescent beads in an agarose phantom with 1% lipid emulsion, measure the power required to keep bead brightness constant at each depth, fit the logarithm against depth to extract l_s and compare with literature; then confirm temperature rise during long scans with an inserted thermocouple or a temperature-sensitive dye.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"維持焦點激發不變所需的表面功率 P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s)。P₀ = 10 mW、l_s = 200 µm 時 600 µm 深需 10×e³ ≈ 201 mW；改用 1300 nm、l_s = 350 µm 只需 10×e^(600/350) ≈ 56 mW。文獻報導腦組織的穩態溫升約為每 100 mW 平均功率 1 到 2 K，因此 200 mW 已接近熱安全邊界。","textEn":"Surface power needed to hold focal excitation constant is P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s). With P₀ = 10 mW and l_s = 200 µm, a depth of 600 µm needs 10×e³ ≈ 201 mW; at 1300 nm with l_s = 350 µm only 10×e^(600/350) ≈ 56 mW. Reported steady-state heating of brain tissue is about 1 to 2 K per 100 mW of average power, so 200 mW already approaches the thermal safety boundary.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice\", which statement holds?","options":["維持焦點激發不變所需的表面功率 P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s)。","功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。","共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["Surface power needed to hold focal excitation constant is P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s).","Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample.","A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"維持焦點激發不變所需的表面功率 P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Surface power needed to hold focal excitation constant is P(z) = P₀·exp(z/l_s). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a427-v12-07","title":"散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「散射組織中的彈道光子」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在含 1% 脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體中埋入螢光珠，量各深度維持相同珠子亮度所需的功率，對深度取對數擬合出 l_s，與文獻值比較；再用插入式熱電偶或溫敏染料確認長時間掃描時的溫升。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Embed fluorescent beads in an agarose phantom with 1% lipid emulsion, measure the power required to keep bead brightness constant at each depth, fit the logarithm against depth to extract l_s and compare with literature; then confirm temperature rise during long scans with an inserted thermocouple or a temperature-sensitive dye. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了在 800 µm 深度得到影像，把平均功率提高到 300 mW 以上，表面附近的離焦激發淹沒訊號且組織局部加熱，影像對比不升反降並伴隨光損傷。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Raising average power above 300 mW to image at 800 µm lets out-of-focus excitation near the surface swamp the signal and heats the tissue locally, so contrast falls rather than rises and photodamage follows.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在含 1% 脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體中埋入螢光珠，量各深度維持相同珠子亮度所需的功率，對深度取對數擬合出 l_s，與文獻值比較；再用插入式熱電偶或溫敏染料確認長時間掃描時的溫升。","textEn":"Embed fluorescent beads in an agarose phantom with 1% lipid emulsion, measure the power required to keep bead brightness constant at each depth, fit the logarithm against depth to extract l_s and compare with literature; then confirm temperature rise during long scans with an inserted thermocouple or a temperature-sensitive dye.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在含 1% 脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體中埋入螢光珠，量各深度維持相同珠子亮度所需的功率，對深度取對數擬合出 l_s，與文獻值比較。","表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Embed fluorescent beads in an agarose phantom with 1% lipid emulsion, measure the power required to keep bead brightness constant at each depth, fit the logarithm against depth to extract l_s and compare with literature.","A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在含 1% 脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體中埋入螢光珠，量各深度維持相同珠子亮度所需的功率，對深度取對數擬合出 l_s，與文獻值比較；再用插入式熱電偶或溫敏染料確認長時間掃描時的溫升。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Embed fluorescent beads in an agarose phantom with 1% lipid emulsion, measure the power required to keep bead brightness constant at each depth, fit the logarithm against depth to extract l_s and compare with literature; then confirm temperature rise during long scans with an inserted thermocouple or a temperature-sensitive dye. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a427-v12-08","title":"散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「散射組織中的彈道光子」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Ballistic photons in scattering tissue” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了在 800 µm 深度得到影像，把平均功率提高到 300 mW 以上，表面附近的離焦激發淹沒訊號且組織局部加熱，影像對比不升反降並伴隨光損傷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Raising average power above 300 mW to image at 800 µm lets out-of-focus excitation near the surface swamp the signal and heats the tissue locally, so contrast falls rather than rises and photodamage follows. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：當表面附近的離焦雙光子背景與焦點訊號相當時，就到達成像深度極限。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The depth limit is reached when out-of-focus two-photon background near the surface equals the focal signal.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了在 800 µm 深度得到影像，把平均功率提高到 300 mW 以上，表面附近的離焦激發淹沒訊號且組織局部加熱，影像對比不升反降並伴隨光損傷。","textEn":"Raising average power above 300 mW to image at 800 µm lets out-of-focus excitation near the surface swamp the signal and heats the tissue locally, so contrast falls rather than rises and photodamage follows.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「散射長度、穿透深度與波長選擇」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scattering length, penetration depth and wavelength choice\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。","為了在 800 µm 深度得到影像，把平均功率提高到 300 mW 以上，表面附近的離焦激發淹沒訊號且組織局部加熱，影像對比不升反降並伴隨光損傷。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.","Raising average power above 300 mW to image at 800 µm lets out-of-focus excitation near the surface swamp the signal and heats the tissue locally, so contrast falls rather than rises and photodamage follows."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了在 800 µm 深度得到影像，把平均功率提高到 300 mW 以上，表面附近的離焦激發淹沒訊號且組織局部加熱，影像對比不升反降並伴隨光損傷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Raising average power above 300 mW to image at 800 µm lets out-of-focus excitation near the surface swamp the signal and heats the tissue locally, so contrast falls rather than rises and photodamage follows. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a427-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償」與「物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation\" and \"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a427-v12-09","title":"飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鈦藍寶石雷射可在 680 到 1080 nm 調諧，摻鐿光纖雷射提供 920 或 1030 nm 的固定波長與較高功率。脈衝通過聲光調制器、掃描透鏡、管鏡與物鏡時，群延遲色散使不同波長成分延遲不同，脈衝在樣品處被展寬數倍，雙光子訊號按 1/τ 下降。預補償以稜鏡對、光柵對或啁啾鏡在雷射出口加入負色散，使脈衝到達焦點時最短；二氧化碲調制器的色散特別大，是常被忽略的來源。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Ti:sapphire lasers tune from 680 to 1080 nm, while ytterbium fibre lasers give fixed 920 or 1030 nm output at higher power. As pulses pass the acousto-optic modulator, scan lens, tube lens and objective, group-delay dispersion delays spectral components differently, so the pulse at the sample stretches several times and two-photon signal falls as 1/τ. Precompensation adds negative dispersion with a prism pair, grating pair or chirped mirrors at the laser output so that the pulse is shortest at the focus; tellurium-dioxide modulators have especially large dispersion and are an often overlooked source. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：高斯脈衝經群延遲色散 GDD 後 τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A Gaussian pulse after group-delay dispersion GDD has τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²).","failure":"常見誤解：「雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-09-k1","title":"飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償","titleEn":"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation","text":"鈦藍寶石雷射可在 680 到 1080 nm 調諧，摻鐿光纖雷射提供 920 或 1030 nm 的固定波長與較高功率。脈衝通過聲光調制器、掃描透鏡、管鏡與物鏡時，群延遲色散使不同波長成分延遲不同，脈衝在樣品處被展寬數倍，雙光子訊號按 1/τ 下降。","textEn":"Ti:sapphire lasers tune from 680 to 1080 nm, while ytterbium fibre lasers give fixed 920 or 1030 nm output at higher power. As pulses pass the acousto-optic modulator, scan lens, tube lens and objective, group-delay dispersion delays spectral components differently, so the pulse at the sample stretches several times and two-photon signal falls as 1/τ.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation\" is correct?","options":["鈦藍寶石雷射可在 680 到 1080 nm 調諧，摻鐿光纖雷射提供 920 或 1030 nm 的固定波長與較高功率。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。","偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。"],"optionsEn":["Ti:sapphire lasers tune from 680 to 1080 nm, while ytterbium fibre lasers give fixed 920 or 1030 nm output at higher power.","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.","Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked."],"answer":0,"explanation":"鈦藍寶石雷射可在 680 到 1080 nm 調諧，摻鐿光纖雷射提供 920 或 1030 nm 的固定波長與較高功率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Ti:sapphire lasers tune from 680 to 1080 nm, while ytterbium fibre lasers give fixed 920 or 1030 nm output at higher power. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a427-v12-10","title":"飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償：定量估算","titleEn":"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：高斯脈衝經群延遲色散 GDD 後 τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²)。τ_in = 100 fs、顯微鏡總 GDD ≈ 5000 fs² 時 4ln2×5000/10⁴ ≈ 1.39，τ_out ≈ 100×√(1 + 1.92) ≈ 171 fs，訊號只剩 100/171 ≈ 58%；預補償 −5000 fs² 可還原到 100 fs，殘留 ±500 fs² 時展寬不到 1%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A Gaussian pulse after group-delay dispersion GDD has τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²). With τ_in = 100 fs and a microscope GDD ≈ 5000 fs², 4ln2×5000/10⁴ ≈ 1.39 and τ_out ≈ 100×√(1 + 1.92) ≈ 171 fs, leaving only 100/171 ≈ 58% of the signal; precompensating −5000 fs² restores 100 fs, and a residual of ±500 fs² broadens by less than 1%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把自相關儀放在物鏡後（以相同物鏡或等效玻璃），量樣品面脈衝寬度並掃描預補償量，找出最短脈衝點；再用螢光素溶液確認訊號在同一設定達最大，兩者的 GDD 設定應一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the autocorrelator after the objective (using the same objective or equivalent glass), measure the pulse width at the sample plane while scanning the precompensation and find the minimum; then confirm with a fluorescein solution that the signal peaks at the same setting, which should agree with the GDD value.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"高斯脈衝經群延遲色散 GDD 後 τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²)。τ_in = 100 fs、顯微鏡總 GDD ≈ 5000 fs² 時 4ln2×5000/10⁴ ≈ 1.39，τ_out ≈ 100×√(1 + 1.92) ≈ 171 fs，訊號只剩 100/171 ≈ 58%；預補償 −5000 fs² 可還原到 100 fs，殘留 ±500 fs² 時展寬不到 1%。","textEn":"A Gaussian pulse after group-delay dispersion GDD has τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²). With τ_in = 100 fs and a microscope GDD ≈ 5000 fs², 4ln2×5000/10⁴ ≈ 1.39 and τ_out ≈ 100×√(1 + 1.92) ≈ 171 fs, leaving only 100/171 ≈ 58% of the signal; precompensating −5000 fs² restores 100 fs, and a residual of ±500 fs² broadens by less than 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation\", which statement holds?","options":["提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。","高斯脈衝經群延遲色散 GDD 後 τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²)。","表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。"],"optionsEn":["Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.","A Gaussian pulse after group-delay dispersion GDD has τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²).","A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高斯脈衝經群延遲色散 GDD 後 τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A Gaussian pulse after group-delay dispersion GDD has τ_out = τ_in·√(1 + (4ln2·GDD/τ_in²)²). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a427-v12-11","title":"飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把自相關儀放在物鏡後（以相同物鏡或等效玻璃），量樣品面脈衝寬度並掃描預補償量，找出最短脈衝點；再用螢光素溶液確認訊號在同一設定達最大，兩者的 GDD 設定應一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the autocorrelator after the objective (using the same objective or equivalent glass), measure the pulse width at the sample plane while scanning the precompensation and find the minimum; then confirm with a fluorescein solution that the signal peaks at the same setting, which should agree with the GDD value. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：更換成色散較大的新物鏡卻沿用舊的預啁啾設定，樣品處脈衝從 100 fs 變成 200 fs，使用者以為雷射功率下降而調高功率，造成不必要的熱負載。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Switching to a new objective with larger dispersion while keeping the old prechirp setting stretches the pulse at the sample from 100 to 200 fs; the user, assuming the laser has lost power, raises the power and adds needless heat load.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把自相關儀放在物鏡後（以相同物鏡或等效玻璃），量樣品面脈衝寬度並掃描預補償量，找出最短脈衝點；再用螢光素溶液確認訊號在同一設定達最大，兩者的 GDD 設定應一致。","textEn":"Place the autocorrelator after the objective (using the same objective or equivalent glass), measure the pulse width at the sample plane while scanning the precompensation and find the minimum; then confirm with a fluorescein solution that the signal peaks at the same setting, which should agree with the GDD value.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","把自相關儀放在物鏡後（以相同物鏡或等效玻璃），量樣品面脈衝寬度並掃描預補償量，找出最短脈衝點。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","Place the autocorrelator after the objective (using the same objective or equivalent glass), measure the pulse width at the sample plane while scanning the precompensation and find the minimum."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把自相關儀放在物鏡後（以相同物鏡或等效玻璃），量樣品面脈衝寬度並掃描預補償量，找出最短脈衝點；再用螢光素溶液確認訊號在同一設定達最大，兩者的 GDD 設定應一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the autocorrelator after the objective (using the same objective or equivalent glass), measure the pulse width at the sample plane while scanning the precompensation and find the minimum; then confirm with a fluorescein solution that the signal peaks at the same setting, which should agree with the GDD value. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a427-v12-12","title":"飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償：失效診斷","titleEn":"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「預啁啾稜鏡對與自相關儀」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Prechirp prism pair and autocorrelator” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"更換成色散較大的新物鏡卻沿用舊的預啁啾設定，樣品處脈衝從 100 fs 變成 200 fs，使用者以為雷射功率下降而調高功率，造成不必要的熱負載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Switching to a new objective with larger dispersion while keeping the old prechirp setting stretches the pulse at the sample from 100 to 200 fs; the user, assuming the laser has lost power, raises the power and adds needless heat load. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：預補償以稜鏡對、光柵對或啁啾鏡在雷射出口加入負色散，使脈衝到達焦點時最短；二氧化碲調制器的色散特別大，是常被忽略的來源。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Precompensation adds negative dispersion with a prism pair, grating pair or chirped mirrors at the laser output so that the pulse is shortest at the focus; tellurium-dioxide modulators have especially large dispersion and are an often overlooked source.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"更換成色散較大的新物鏡卻沿用舊的預啁啾設定，樣品處脈衝從 100 fs 變成 200 fs，使用者以為雷射功率下降而調高功率，造成不必要的熱負載。","textEn":"Switching to a new objective with larger dispersion while keeping the old prechirp setting stretches the pulse at the sample from 100 to 200 fs; the user, assuming the laser has lost power, raises the power and adds needless heat load.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「飛秒雷射、群延遲色散與脈衝預補償」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Femtosecond laser, group-delay dispersion and pulse precompensation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["更換成色散較大的新物鏡卻沿用舊的預啁啾設定，樣品處脈衝從 100 fs 變成 200 fs，使用者以為雷射功率下降而調高功率，造成不必要的熱負載。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。"],"optionsEn":["Switching to a new objective with larger dispersion while keeping the old prechirp setting stretches the pulse at the sample from 100 to 200 fs.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked."],"answer":0,"explanation":"更換成色散較大的新物鏡卻沿用舊的預啁啾設定，樣品處脈衝從 100 fs 變成 200 fs，使用者以為雷射功率下降而調高功率，造成不必要的熱負載。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Switching to a new objective with larger dispersion while keeping the old prechirp setting stretches the pulse at the sample from 100 to 200 fs; the user, assuming the laser has lost power, raises the power and adds needless heat load. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a427-v12-13","title":"物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"雙光子用低放大率、高數值孔徑、長工作距離的水浸物鏡，其後孔徑可達 15 到 20 mm，雷射光束必須擴束到填滿後孔徑才能得到設計的數值孔徑與最小激發體積。螢光從深處出射時幾乎全部被散射，離開表面時分布在遠大於焦點的區域；非去掃描偵測把 GaAsP 光電倍增管放在物鏡後方最近處，以大面積直接收集，而不是把光送回掃描器與針孔。偵測路徑只需阻擋激發光，不需成像品質。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Two-photon systems use low-magnification, high-NA, long-working-distance water-immersion objectives whose back apertures reach 15 to 20 mm, and the laser beam must be expanded to fill that aperture to obtain the design NA and the smallest excitation volume. Fluorescence leaving deep tissue is almost entirely scattered and emerges over an area far larger than the focus; non-descanned detection places GaAsP photomultipliers as close as possible behind the objective to collect over a large area instead of returning light through the scanner and a pinhole. The detection path only has to block the excitation and needs no imaging quality. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：25×/1.05 水鏡配 180 mm 管鏡，f_obj = 7.2 mm，後孔徑 ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm；從 2 mm 雷射光束擴到 15 mm 需 7.5 倍擴束。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 25×/1.05 water objective with a 180 mm tube lens has f_obj = 7.2 mm and a back aperture ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm, so a 2 mm laser beam needs 7.5× expansion.","failure":"常見誤解：「偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-13-k1","title":"物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測","titleEn":"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection","text":"雙光子用低放大率、高數值孔徑、長工作距離的水浸物鏡，其後孔徑可達 15 到 20 mm，雷射光束必須擴束到填滿後孔徑才能得到設計的數值孔徑與最小激發體積。螢光從深處出射時幾乎全部被散射，離開表面時分布在遠大於焦點的區域；非去掃描偵測把 GaAsP 光電倍增管放在物鏡後方最近處，以大面積直接收集，而不是把光送回掃描器與針孔。","textEn":"Two-photon systems use low-magnification, high-NA, long-working-distance water-immersion objectives whose back apertures reach 15 to 20 mm, and the laser beam must be expanded to fill that aperture to obtain the design NA and the smallest excitation volume. Fluorescence leaving deep tissue is almost entirely scattered and emerges over an area far larger than the focus; non-descanned detection places GaAsP photomultipliers as close as possible behind the objective to collect over a large area instead of returning light through the scanner and a pinhole.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection\" is correct?","options":["偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。","雙光子用低放大率、高數值孔徑、長工作距離的水浸物鏡，其後孔徑可達 15 到 20 mm，雷射光束必須擴束到填滿後孔徑才能得到設計的數值孔徑與最小激發體積。","功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。"],"optionsEn":["Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.","Two-photon systems use low-magnification, high-NA, long-working-distance water-immersion objectives whose back apertures reach 15 to 20 mm, and the laser beam must be expanded to fill that aperture to obtain the design NA and the smallest excitation volume.","Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"雙光子用低放大率、高數值孔徑、長工作距離的水浸物鏡，其後孔徑可達 15 到 20 mm，雷射光束必須擴束到填滿後孔徑才能得到設計的數值孔徑與最小激發體積。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Two-photon systems use low-magnification, high-NA, long-working-distance water-immersion objectives whose back apertures reach 15 to 20 mm, and the laser beam must be expanded to fill that aperture to obtain the design NA and the smallest excitation volume. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a427-v12-14","title":"物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測：定量估算","titleEn":"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：25×/1.05 水鏡配 180 mm 管鏡，f_obj = 7.2 mm，後孔徑 ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm；從 2 mm 雷射光束擴到 15 mm 需 7.5 倍擴束。視場 = 視場數/放大率 = 18/25 = 0.72 mm。雙光子點擴散函數（1/e 半徑）ω_xy ≈ 0.325·λ/(√2·NA^0.91) ≈ 0.21 µm、ω_z ≈ 0.532·λ/[√2(n − √(n² − NA²))] ≈ 0.76 µm，半高寬約 0.35 與 1.27 µm，激發體積 ≈ π^1.5·ω_xy²·ω_z ≈ 0.19 fL。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 25×/1.05 water objective with a 180 mm tube lens has f_obj = 7.2 mm and a back aperture ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm, so a 2 mm laser beam needs 7.5× expansion. Field of view = field number/magnification = 18/25 = 0.72 mm. The two-photon point-spread function (1/e radii) is ω_xy ≈ 0.325·λ/(√2·NA^0.91) ≈ 0.21 µm and ω_z ≈ 0.532·λ/[√2(n − √(n² − NA²))] ≈ 0.76 µm, FWHM about 0.35 and 1.27 µm, with an excitation volume ≈ π^1.5·ω_xy²·ω_z ≈ 0.19 fL. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在物鏡後孔徑位置用光束輪廓儀量光束直徑，確認 1/e² 直徑不小於孔徑；以 0.2 µm 螢光珠量三維半高寬並與 0.35、1.27 µm 比較；比較同一深度非去掃描與去掃描路徑的訊號比，記錄隨深度的增益。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the beam diameter at the objective back aperture with a beam profiler and confirm the 1/e² diameter is not smaller than the aperture; measure the three-dimensional FWHM with 0.2 µm fluorescent beads against 0.35 and 1.27 µm; compare signal through the non-descanned and descanned paths at the same depth and log the gain with depth.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"25×/1.05 水鏡配 180 mm 管鏡，f_obj = 7.2 mm，後孔徑 ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm；從 2 mm 雷射光束擴到 15 mm 需 7.5 倍擴束。視場 = 視場數/放大率 = 18/25 = 0.72 mm。雙光子點擴散函數（1/e 半徑）ω_xy ≈ 0.325·λ/(√2·NA^0.91) ≈ 0.21 µm、ω_z ≈ 0.532·λ/[√2(n − √(n² − NA²))] ≈ 0.76 µm，半高寬約 0.35 與 1.27 µm，激發體積 ≈ π^1.5·ω_xy²·ω_z ≈ 0.19 fL。","textEn":"A 25×/1.05 water objective with a 180 mm tube lens has f_obj = 7.2 mm and a back aperture ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm, so a 2 mm laser beam needs 7.5× expansion. Field of view = field number/magnification = 18/25 = 0.72 mm. The two-photon point-spread function (1/e radii) is ω_xy ≈ 0.325·λ/(√2·NA^0.91) ≈ 0.21 µm and ω_z ≈ 0.532·λ/[√2(n − √(n² − NA²))] ≈ 0.76 µm, FWHM about 0.35 and 1.27 µm, with an excitation volume ≈ π^1.5·ω_xy²·ω_z ≈ 0.19 fL.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection\", which statement holds?","options":["共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。","雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","25×/1.05 水鏡配 180 mm 管鏡，f_obj = 7.2 mm，後孔徑 ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm。"],"optionsEn":["A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality.","A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","A 25×/1.05 water objective with a 180 mm tube lens has f_obj = 7.2 mm and a back aperture ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm, so a 2 mm laser beam needs 7.5× expansion."],"answer":2,"explanation":"25×/1.05 水鏡配 180 mm 管鏡，f_obj = 7.2 mm，後孔徑 ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm；從 2 mm 雷射光束擴到 15 mm 需 7.5 倍擴束。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 25×/1.05 water objective with a 180 mm tube lens has f_obj = 7.2 mm and a back aperture ≈ 2·NA·f = 15.1 mm, so a 2 mm laser beam needs 7.5× expansion. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a427-v12-15","title":"物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在物鏡後孔徑位置用光束輪廓儀量光束直徑，確認 1/e² 直徑不小於孔徑；以 0.2 µm 螢光珠量三維半高寬並與 0.35、1.27 µm 比較；比較同一深度非去掃描與去掃描路徑的訊號比，記錄隨深度的增益。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the beam diameter at the objective back aperture with a beam profiler and confirm the 1/e² diameter is not smaller than the aperture; measure the three-dimensional FWHM with 0.2 µm fluorescent beads against 0.35 and 1.27 µm; compare signal through the non-descanned and descanned paths at the same depth and log the gain with depth. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光束只填滿後孔徑的 60%，有效數值孔徑降到約 0.63，軸向半高寬變為 3 µm 以上，激發體積膨脹且同樣功率下 I² 訊號大減，深層影像模糊。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A beam filling only 60% of the back aperture lowers the effective NA to about 0.63, the axial FWHM grows beyond 3 µm, the excitation volume swells, the I² signal at the same power drops sharply and deep images blur.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在物鏡後孔徑位置用光束輪廓儀量光束直徑，確認 1/e² 直徑不小於孔徑；以 0.2 µm 螢光珠量三維半高寬並與 0.35、1.27 µm 比較；比較同一深度非去掃描與去掃描路徑的訊號比，記錄隨深度的增益。","textEn":"Measure the beam diameter at the objective back aperture with a beam profiler and confirm the 1/e² diameter is not smaller than the aperture; measure the three-dimensional FWHM with 0.2 µm fluorescent beads against 0.35 and 1.27 µm; compare signal through the non-descanned and descanned paths at the same depth and log the gain with depth.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection\"?","options":["在物鏡後孔徑位置用光束輪廓儀量光束直徑，確認 1/e² 直徑不小於孔徑。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。"],"optionsEn":["Measure the beam diameter at the objective back aperture with a beam profiler and confirm the 1/e² diameter is not smaller than the aperture.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在物鏡後孔徑位置用光束輪廓儀量光束直徑，確認 1/e² 直徑不小於孔徑；以 0.2 µm 螢光珠量三維半高寬並與 0.35、1.27 µm 比較；比較同一深度非去掃描與去掃描路徑的訊號比，記錄隨深度的增益。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the beam diameter at the objective back aperture with a beam profiler and confirm the 1/e² diameter is not smaller than the aperture; measure the three-dimensional FWHM with 0.2 µm fluorescent beads against 0.35 and 1.27 µm; compare signal through the non-descanned and descanned paths at the same depth and log the gain with depth. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a427-v12-16","title":"物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「大瞳孔物鏡與非去掃描偵測器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Large-pupil objective and non-descanned detector” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光束只填滿後孔徑的 60%，有效數值孔徑降到約 0.63，軸向半高寬變為 3 µm 以上，激發體積膨脹且同樣功率下 I² 訊號大減，深層影像模糊。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A beam filling only 60% of the back aperture lowers the effective NA to about 0.63, the axial FWHM grows beyond 3 µm, the excitation volume swells, the I² signal at the same power drops sharply and deep images blur. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：偵測路徑只需阻擋激發光，不需成像品質。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The detection path only has to block the excitation and needs no imaging quality.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光束只填滿後孔徑的 60%，有效數值孔徑降到約 0.63，軸向半高寬變為 3 µm 以上，激發體積膨脹且同樣功率下 I² 訊號大減，深層影像模糊。","textEn":"A beam filling only 60% of the back aperture lowers the effective NA to about 0.63, the axial FWHM grows beyond 3 µm, the excitation volume swells, the I² signal at the same power drops sharply and deep images blur.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「物鏡、光束擴束與非去掃描偵測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Objective, beam expansion and non-descanned detection\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","光束只填滿後孔徑的 60%，有效數值孔徑降到約 0.63，軸向半高寬變為 3 µm 以上，激發體積膨脹且同樣功率下 I² 訊號大減，深層影像模糊。","功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A beam filling only 60% of the back aperture lowers the effective NA to about 0.63, the axial FWHM grows beyond 3 µm, the excitation volume swells, the I² signal at the same power drops sharply and deep images blur.","Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光束只填滿後孔徑的 60%，有效數值孔徑降到約 0.63，軸向半高寬變為 3 µm 以上，激發體積膨脹且同樣功率下 I² 訊號大減，深層影像模糊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A beam filling only 60% of the back aperture lowers the effective NA to about 0.63, the axial FWHM grows beyond 3 µm, the excitation volume swells, the I² signal at the same power drops sharply and deep images blur. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a427-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正」與「散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration\" and \"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a427-v12-17","title":"功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"因為訊號與功率平方成正比，功率的校正誤差會被放大兩倍；Pockels 盒的穿透率對電壓是正弦曲線，必須以樣品面的功率計建立對照表並定期重量。脈衝寬度要在樣品面以自相關儀量，雙曲正割脈衝的自相關半高寬是脈衝寬度的 1.54 倍。點擴散函數以 0.2 µm 珠子在表面與深處各量一次，判斷光束填充、色散與球差狀態。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Because signal scales with the square of power, any power calibration error is doubled; the transmission of a Pockels cell is sinusoidal in voltage, so a lookup table must be built with a power meter at the sample plane and re-measured periodically. Pulse width is measured at the sample plane with an autocorrelator, where the autocorrelation FWHM of a hyperbolic-secant pulse is 1.54 times the pulse width. The point-spread function is measured with 0.2 µm beads at the surface and at depth to judge beam filling, dispersion and spherical aberration. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：功率誤差 1% 造成訊號誤差 2%，5% 造成 10%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 1% power error gives a 2% signal error and 5% gives 10%.","failure":"常見誤解：「功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-17-k1","title":"功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正","titleEn":"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration","text":"因為訊號與功率平方成正比，功率的校正誤差會被放大兩倍；Pockels 盒的穿透率對電壓是正弦曲線，必須以樣品面的功率計建立對照表並定期重量。脈衝寬度要在樣品面以自相關儀量，雙曲正割脈衝的自相關半高寬是脈衝寬度的 1.54 倍。","textEn":"Because signal scales with the square of power, any power calibration error is doubled; the transmission of a Pockels cell is sinusoidal in voltage, so a lookup table must be built with a power meter at the sample plane and re-measured periodically. Pulse width is measured at the sample plane with an autocorrelator, where the autocorrelation FWHM of a hyperbolic-secant pulse is 1.54 times the pulse width.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration\" is correct?","options":["功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。","提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。","因為訊號與功率平方成正比，功率的校正誤差會被放大兩倍；Pockels 盒的穿透率對電壓是正弦曲線，必須以樣品面的功率計建立對照表並定期重量。"],"optionsEn":["Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample.","Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.","Because signal scales with the square of power, any power calibration error is doubled."],"answer":2,"explanation":"因為訊號與功率平方成正比，功率的校正誤差會被放大兩倍；Pockels 盒的穿透率對電壓是正弦曲線，必須以樣品面的功率計建立對照表並定期重量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Because signal scales with the square of power, any power calibration error is doubled; the transmission of a Pockels cell is sinusoidal in voltage, so a lookup table must be built with a power meter at the sample plane and re-measured periodically. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a427-v12-18","title":"功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：功率誤差 1% 造成訊號誤差 2%，5% 造成 10%。自相關半高寬 263 fs 對應 263/1.54 ≈ 171 fs 的脈衝，表示預補償不足；達到 154 fs 的自相關才對應 100 fs。功率系列 5、10、20 mW 量到相對訊號 1、4.1、16.4，log-log 斜率 log(16.4)/log(4) ≈ 2.02，確認平方律。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 1% power error gives a 2% signal error and 5% gives 10%. An autocorrelation FWHM of 263 fs corresponds to a 263/1.54 ≈ 171 fs pulse, indicating insufficient precompensation; only a 154 fs autocorrelation corresponds to 100 fs. A power series at 5, 10 and 20 mW giving relative signals 1, 4.1 and 16.4 has a log-log slope log(16.4)/log(4) ≈ 2.02, confirming the square law. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每週用熱電堆功率計在物鏡後量 10 個 Pockels 設定的功率並更新對照表；每次更換物鏡或波長後量自相關；每月量表面珠子的三維半高寬，與驗收基準比較並畫趨勢圖。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Weekly, measure power after the objective at 10 Pockels settings with a thermopile power meter and update the lookup table; after every objective or wavelength change measure the autocorrelation; monthly, measure the three-dimensional FWHM of surface beads and plot the trend against the acceptance baseline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"功率誤差 1% 造成訊號誤差 2%，5% 造成 10%。自相關半高寬 263 fs 對應 263/1.54 ≈ 171 fs 的脈衝，表示預補償不足；達到 154 fs 的自相關才對應 100 fs。功率系列 5、10、20 mW 量到相對訊號 1、4.1、16.4，log-log 斜率 log(16.4)/log(4) ≈ 2.02，確認平方律。","textEn":"A 1% power error gives a 2% signal error and 5% gives 10%. An autocorrelation FWHM of 263 fs corresponds to a 263/1.54 ≈ 171 fs pulse, indicating insufficient precompensation; only a 154 fs autocorrelation corresponds to 100 fs. A power series at 5, 10 and 20 mW giving relative signals 1, 4.1 and 16.4 has a log-log slope log(16.4)/log(4) ≈ 2.02, confirming the square law.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration\", which statement holds?","options":["功率誤差 1% 造成訊號誤差 2%，5% 造成 10%。","表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。","只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。"],"optionsEn":["A 1% power error gives a 2% signal error and 5% gives 10%.","A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth.","With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth."],"answer":0,"explanation":"功率誤差 1% 造成訊號誤差 2%，5% 造成 10%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 1% power error gives a 2% signal error and 5% gives 10%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a427-v12-19","title":"功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每週用熱電堆功率計在物鏡後量 10 個 Pockels 設定的功率並更新對照表；每次更換物鏡或波長後量自相關；每月量表面珠子的三維半高寬，與驗收基準比較並畫趨勢圖。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Weekly, measure power after the objective at 10 Pockels settings with a thermopile power meter and update the lookup table; after every objective or wavelength change measure the autocorrelation; monthly, measure the three-dimensional FWHM of surface beads and plot the trend against the acceptance baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用雷射出口的功率值換算樣品功率而忽略物鏡在 920 nm 僅約 70% 的穿透率，實際功率低估 30%，訊號預期值錯 50% 以上，且不同系統間的結果無法比較。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Converting laser-output power to sample power while ignoring an objective transmission of only about 70% at 920 nm underestimates the real power by 30%, puts the expected signal off by more than 50% and makes results incomparable across systems.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每週用熱電堆功率計在物鏡後量 10 個 Pockels 設定的功率並更新對照表；每次更換物鏡或波長後量自相關；每月量表面珠子的三維半高寬，與驗收基準比較並畫趨勢圖。","textEn":"Weekly, measure power after the objective at 10 Pockels settings with a thermopile power meter and update the lookup table; after every objective or wavelength change measure the autocorrelation; monthly, measure the three-dimensional FWHM of surface beads and plot the trend against the acceptance baseline.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","每週用熱電堆功率計在物鏡後量 10 個 Pockels 設定的功率並更新對照表。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Weekly, measure power after the objective at 10 Pockels settings with a thermopile power meter and update the lookup table.","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每週用熱電堆功率計在物鏡後量 10 個 Pockels 設定的功率並更新對照表；每次更換物鏡或波長後量自相關；每月量表面珠子的三維半高寬，與驗收基準比較並畫趨勢圖。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Weekly, measure power after the objective at 10 Pockels settings with a thermopile power meter and update the lookup table; after every objective or wavelength change measure the autocorrelation; monthly, measure the three-dimensional FWHM of surface beads and plot the trend against the acceptance baseline. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a427-v12-20","title":"功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「樣品面功率計與功率平方曲線」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Sample-plane power meter and P² curve” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用雷射出口的功率值換算樣品功率而忽略物鏡在 920 nm 僅約 70% 的穿透率，實際功率低估 30%，訊號預期值錯 50% 以上，且不同系統間的結果無法比較。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Converting laser-output power to sample power while ignoring an objective transmission of only about 70% at 920 nm underestimates the real power by 30%, puts the expected signal off by more than 50% and makes results incomparable across systems. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：點擴散函數以 0.2 µm 珠子在表面與深處各量一次，判斷光束填充、色散與球差狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The point-spread function is measured with 0.2 µm beads at the surface and at depth to judge beam filling, dispersion and spherical aberration.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用雷射出口的功率值換算樣品功率而忽略物鏡在 920 nm 僅約 70% 的穿透率，實際功率低估 30%，訊號預期值錯 50% 以上，且不同系統間的結果無法比較。","textEn":"Converting laser-output power to sample power while ignoring an objective transmission of only about 70% at 920 nm underestimates the real power by 30%, puts the expected signal off by more than 50% and makes results incomparable across systems.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「功率、脈衝與點擴散函數校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Power, pulse and point-spread calibration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。","用雷射出口的功率值換算樣品功率而忽略物鏡在 920 nm 僅約 70% 的穿透率，實際功率低估 30%，訊號預期值錯 50% 以上，且不同系統間的結果無法比較。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.","Converting laser-output power to sample power while ignoring an objective transmission of only about 70% at 920 nm underestimates the real power by 30%, puts the expected signal off by more than 50% and makes results incomparable across systems."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用雷射出口的功率值換算樣品功率而忽略物鏡在 920 nm 僅約 70% 的穿透率，實際功率低估 30%，訊號預期值錯 50% 以上，且不同系統間的結果無法比較。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Converting laser-output power to sample power while ignoring an objective transmission of only about 70% at 920 nm underestimates the real power by 30%, puts the expected signal off by more than 50% and makes results incomparable across systems. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a427-v12-21","title":"散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"雙光子影像每像素的光子數常只有個位數到數十個，散粒雜訊主導；光電倍增管的增益起伏再引入過量雜訊因子 F，GaAsP 管約 1.2 到 1.4，使有效信噪比下降。改善途徑是提高每脈衝激發效率、增加停留時間或幀平均，而非單純加功率。熱負載來自水對近紅外的吸收與組織散射後的沉積，與平均功率成正比；1300 nm 的水吸收比 920 nm 高約 20 倍，同樣功率下發熱更明顯。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A two-photon image often holds only single digits to tens of photons per pixel, so shot noise dominates; gain fluctuations of the photomultiplier add an excess-noise factor F of about 1.2 to 1.4 for GaAsP tubes, lowering the effective signal-to-noise ratio. Improvement comes from higher per-pulse excitation efficiency, longer dwell or frame averaging rather than simply more power. Heat load comes from water absorption of near-infrared light and deposition of scattered light, proportional to average power; water absorbs about 20 times more at 1300 nm than at 920 nm, so the same power heats more. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：SNR ≈ N/√(F·N)：N = 10 個偵測光子、F = 1.3 時 SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8；4 幀平均 ≈ 5.5，16 幀 ≈ 11。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: SNR ≈ N/√(F·N): with N = 10 detected photons and F = 1.3, SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8; averaging 4 frames gives ≈ 5.5 and 16 frames ≈ 11.","failure":"常見誤解：「提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-21-k1","title":"散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算","titleEn":"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget","text":"雙光子影像每像素的光子數常只有個位數到數十個，散粒雜訊主導；光電倍增管的增益起伏再引入過量雜訊因子 F，GaAsP 管約 1.2 到 1.4，使有效信噪比下降。改善途徑是提高每脈衝激發效率、增加停留時間或幀平均，而非單純加功率。","textEn":"A two-photon image often holds only single digits to tens of photons per pixel, so shot noise dominates; gain fluctuations of the photomultiplier add an excess-noise factor F of about 1.2 to 1.4 for GaAsP tubes, lowering the effective signal-to-noise ratio. Improvement comes from higher per-pulse excitation efficiency, longer dwell or frame averaging rather than simply more power.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget\" is correct?","options":["雙光子影像每像素的光子數常只有個位數到數十個，散粒雜訊主導；光電倍增管的增益起伏再引入過量雜訊因子 F，GaAsP 管約 1.2 到 1.4，使有效信噪比下降。","提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。","共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["A two-photon image often holds only single digits to tens of photons per pixel, so shot noise dominates.","Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.","A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"雙光子影像每像素的光子數常只有個位數到數十個，散粒雜訊主導；光電倍增管的增益起伏再引入過量雜訊因子 F，GaAsP 管約 1.2 到 1.4，使有效信噪比下降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A two-photon image often holds only single digits to tens of photons per pixel, so shot noise dominates; gain fluctuations of the photomultiplier add an excess-noise factor F of about 1.2 to 1.4 for GaAsP tubes, lowering the effective signal-to-noise ratio. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a427-v12-22","title":"散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：SNR ≈ N/√(F·N)：N = 10 個偵測光子、F = 1.3 時 SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8；4 幀平均 ≈ 5.5，16 幀 ≈ 11。水的吸收係數約 0.06 cm⁻¹（920 nm）對約 1.3 cm⁻¹（1300 nm）；以每 100 mW 約 1.8 K 的報導值估計，920 nm 下 150 mW 平均功率的穩態溫升約 2.7 K。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: SNR ≈ N/√(F·N): with N = 10 detected photons and F = 1.3, SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8; averaging 4 frames gives ≈ 5.5 and 16 frames ≈ 11. Water absorption is about 0.06 cm⁻¹ at 920 nm versus about 1.3 cm⁻¹ at 1300 nm; using the reported value of about 1.8 K per 100 mW, 150 mW average power at 920 nm produces a steady-state rise of about 2.7 K. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以光子計數模式記錄均勻螢光片的像素直方圖，計算平均與變異數之比得到有效的 F；比較 1、4、16 幀平均的 SNR 是否按 √N 提升；在假體中以熱電偶量不同平均功率的穩態溫升並與線性模型比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record the pixel histogram of a uniform fluorescent slide in photon-counting mode and take the variance-to-mean ratio to obtain the effective F; check whether SNR rises as √N for 1, 4 and 16 frame averages; measure steady-state temperature rise in a phantom at several average powers with a thermocouple and compare with the linear model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"SNR ≈ N/√(F·N)：N = 10 個偵測光子、F = 1.3 時 SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8；4 幀平均 ≈ 5.5，16 幀 ≈ 11。水的吸收係數約 0.06 cm⁻¹（920 nm）對約 1.3 cm⁻¹（1300 nm）；以每 100 mW 約 1.8 K 的報導值估計，920 nm 下 150 mW 平均功率的穩態溫升約 2.7 K。","textEn":"SNR ≈ N/√(F·N): with N = 10 detected photons and F = 1.3, SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8; averaging 4 frames gives ≈ 5.5 and 16 frames ≈ 11. Water absorption is about 0.06 cm⁻¹ at 920 nm versus about 1.3 cm⁻¹ at 1300 nm; using the reported value of about 1.8 K per 100 mW, 150 mW average power at 920 nm produces a steady-state rise of about 2.7 K.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget\", which statement holds?","options":["雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","SNR ≈ N/√(F·N)：N = 10 個偵測光子、F = 1.3 時 SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8；4 幀平均 ≈ 5.5，16 幀 ≈ 11。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。"],"optionsEn":["A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","SNR ≈ N/√(F·N): with N = 10 detected photons and F = 1.3, SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8; averaging 4 frames gives ≈ 5.5 and 16 frames ≈ 11.","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample."],"answer":1,"explanation":"SNR ≈ N/√(F·N)：N = 10 個偵測光子、F = 1.3 時 SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8；4 幀平均 ≈ 5.5，16 幀 ≈ 11。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"SNR ≈ N/√(F·N): with N = 10 detected photons and F = 1.3, SNR ≈ 10/√13 ≈ 2.8; averaging 4 frames gives ≈ 5.5 and 16 frames ≈ 11. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a427-v12-23","title":"散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以光子計數模式記錄均勻螢光片的像素直方圖，計算平均與變異數之比得到有效的 F；比較 1、4、16 幀平均的 SNR 是否按 √N 提升；在假體中以熱電偶量不同平均功率的穩態溫升並與線性模型比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record the pixel histogram of a uniform fluorescent slide in photon-counting mode and take the variance-to-mean ratio to obtain the effective F; check whether SNR rises as √N for 1, 4 and 16 frame averages; measure steady-state temperature rise in a phantom at several average powers with a thermocouple and compare with the linear model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把偵測器增益調到最高以求亮度，暗計數與增益雜訊上升，而光子數並未增加，影像看似更亮卻 SNR 更差；同時高功率長時間掃描使組織溫升超過 2 K，神經活動本身被改變。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Turning detector gain to maximum for brightness raises dark counts and gain noise without adding photons, so the image looks brighter but has worse SNR; meanwhile long high-power scans push tissue temperature up by more than 2 K and alter the neural activity being studied.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以光子計數模式記錄均勻螢光片的像素直方圖，計算平均與變異數之比得到有效的 F；比較 1、4、16 幀平均的 SNR 是否按 √N 提升；在假體中以熱電偶量不同平均功率的穩態溫升並與線性模型比較。","textEn":"Record the pixel histogram of a uniform fluorescent slide in photon-counting mode and take the variance-to-mean ratio to obtain the effective F; check whether SNR rises as √N for 1, 4 and 16 frame averages; measure steady-state temperature rise in a phantom at several average powers with a thermocouple and compare with the linear model.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。","以光子計數模式記錄均勻螢光片的像素直方圖，計算平均與變異數之比得到有效的 F。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.","Record the pixel histogram of a uniform fluorescent slide in photon-counting mode and take the variance-to-mean ratio to obtain the effective F."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以光子計數模式記錄均勻螢光片的像素直方圖，計算平均與變異數之比得到有效的 F；比較 1、4、16 幀平均的 SNR 是否按 √N 提升；在假體中以熱電偶量不同平均功率的穩態溫升並與線性模型比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record the pixel histogram of a uniform fluorescent slide in photon-counting mode and take the variance-to-mean ratio to obtain the effective F; check whether SNR rises as √N for 1, 4 and 16 frame averages; measure steady-state temperature rise in a phantom at several average powers with a thermocouple and compare with the linear model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a427-v12-24","title":"散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光子計數直方圖與熱負載估計」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Photon-count histogram and heat-load estimate” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把偵測器增益調到最高以求亮度，暗計數與增益雜訊上升，而光子數並未增加，影像看似更亮卻 SNR 更差；同時高功率長時間掃描使組織溫升超過 2 K，神經活動本身被改變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Turning detector gain to maximum for brightness raises dark counts and gain noise without adding photons, so the image looks brighter but has worse SNR; meanwhile long high-power scans push tissue temperature up by more than 2 K and alter the neural activity being studied. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：熱負載來自水對近紅外的吸收與組織散射後的沉積，與平均功率成正比；1300 nm 的水吸收比 920 nm 高約 20 倍，同樣功率下發熱更明顯。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Heat load comes from water absorption of near-infrared light and deposition of scattered light, proportional to average power; water absorbs about 20 times more at 1300 nm than at 920 nm, so the same power heats more.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把偵測器增益調到最高以求亮度，暗計數與增益雜訊上升，而光子數並未增加，影像看似更亮卻 SNR 更差；同時高功率長時間掃描使組織溫升超過 2 K，神經活動本身被改變。","textEn":"Turning detector gain to maximum for brightness raises dark counts and gain noise without adding photons, so the image looks brighter but has worse SNR; meanwhile long high-power scans push tissue temperature up by more than 2 K and alter the neural activity being studied.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「散粒雜訊、偵測器雜訊與熱負載預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Shot noise, detector noise and the heat-load budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把偵測器增益調到最高以求亮度，暗計數與增益雜訊上升，而光子數並未增加，影像看似更亮卻 SNR 更差。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。"],"optionsEn":["Turning detector gain to maximum for brightness raises dark counts and gain noise without adding photons, so the image looks brighter but has worse SNR.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把偵測器增益調到最高以求亮度，暗計數與增益雜訊上升，而光子數並未增加，影像看似更亮卻 SNR 更差；同時高功率長時間掃描使組織溫升超過 2 K，神經活動本身被改變。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Turning detector gain to maximum for brightness raises dark counts and gain noise without adding photons, so the image looks brighter but has worse SNR; meanwhile long high-power scans push tissue temperature up by more than 2 K and alter the neural activity being studied. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a427-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合」與「系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scan timing, power gating and system integration\" and \"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a427-v12-25","title":"掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scan timing, power gating and system integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「共振掃描器與像素時脈」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Resonant scanner and pixel clock” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"整合階段把雷射、預補償、Pockels 盒、掃描器、物鏡 z 驅動與偵測器納入同一時序。共振掃描器以固定 8 kHz 正弦擺動，雙向取線可達每秒 16,000 條線，但像素停留時間縮到數十奈秒，每像素只落下幾個雷射脈衝，訊號極度受限；振鏡掃描則慢但停留時間長。Pockels 盒在回程與視場外閘控雷射以減少劑量；正弦速度不均需以像素時脈補償，否則視場邊緣被拉伸。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「共振掃描器與像素時脈」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Integration brings the laser, precompensation, Pockels cell, scanners, objective z-drive and detectors into one timing scheme. A resonant scanner oscillates sinusoidally at a fixed 8 kHz and bidirectional acquisition yields 16,000 lines per second, but pixel dwell shrinks to tens of nanoseconds so only a few laser pulses land per pixel and signal is severely limited; galvanometer scanning is slower but dwells longer. The Pockels cell gates the laser during fly-back and outside the field to cut dose, and the nonuniform sinusoidal velocity must be corrected with the pixel clock or the field edges stretch. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Resonant scanner and pixel clock”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：8 kHz 共振、雙向取線：512 條線需 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms，幀率約 31 Hz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Resonant 8 kHz with bidirectional lines: 512 lines take 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms, about 31 Hz frame rate.","failure":"常見誤解：「共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「共振掃描器與像素時脈」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Resonant scanner and pixel clock”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-25-k1","title":"掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合","titleEn":"Scan timing, power gating and system integration","text":"整合階段把雷射、預補償、Pockels 盒、掃描器、物鏡 z 驅動與偵測器納入同一時序。共振掃描器以固定 8 kHz 正弦擺動，雙向取線可達每秒 16,000 條線，但像素停留時間縮到數十奈秒，每像素只落下幾個雷射脈衝，訊號極度受限；振鏡掃描則慢但停留時間長。","textEn":"Integration brings the laser, precompensation, Pockels cell, scanners, objective z-drive and detectors into one timing scheme. A resonant scanner oscillates sinusoidally at a fixed 8 kHz and bidirectional acquisition yields 16,000 lines per second, but pixel dwell shrinks to tens of nanoseconds so only a few laser pulses land per pixel and signal is severely limited; galvanometer scanning is slower but dwells longer.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scan timing, power gating and system integration\" is correct?","options":["共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。","整合階段把雷射、預補償、Pockels 盒、掃描器、物鏡 z 驅動與偵測器納入同一時序。","表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。"],"optionsEn":["A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality.","Integration brings the laser, precompensation, Pockels cell, scanners, objective z-drive and detectors into one timing scheme.","A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"整合階段把雷射、預補償、Pockels 盒、掃描器、物鏡 z 驅動與偵測器納入同一時序。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Integration brings the laser, precompensation, Pockels cell, scanners, objective z-drive and detectors into one timing scheme. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a427-v12-26","title":"掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Scan timing, power gating and system integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「共振掃描器與像素時脈」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Resonant scanner and pixel clock” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：8 kHz 共振、雙向取線：512 條線需 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms，幀率約 31 Hz。半週期 62.5 µs 中約 50 µs 可用，512 像素平均停留 ≈ 98 ns，視場中央速度為平均的 π/2 倍，停留 ≈ 62 ns，在 80 MHz 下只有約 5 個脈衝；若改用 4 MHz 雷射則每像素僅 0.25 個脈衝，共振掃描不可行。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Resonant 8 kHz with bidirectional lines: 512 lines take 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms, about 31 Hz frame rate. Of each 62.5 µs half period about 50 µs is usable, so 512 pixels dwell ≈ 98 ns on average; at the field centre the velocity is π/2 times the mean, dwell ≈ 62 ns, only about 5 pulses at 80 MHz; with a 4 MHz laser only 0.25 pulses per pixel would land, so resonant scanning would be unusable. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用示波器同時觀察共振掃描器的相位回授、像素時脈與 Pockels 閘控訊號，確認閘控在回程期間關閉且像素時脈隨正弦速度變化；以格線標板影像檢查邊緣與中央的比例尺是否一致，偏差超過 1% 時重新校正像素時脈。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Observe the resonant scanner phase feedback, pixel clock and Pockels gating together on an oscilloscope, confirming that gating closes during fly-back and the pixel clock follows the sinusoidal velocity; check with a grid-target image that scale at the edges matches the centre and recalibrate the pixel clock if the deviation exceeds 1%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"8 kHz 共振、雙向取線：512 條線需 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms，幀率約 31 Hz。半週期 62.5 µs 中約 50 µs 可用，512 像素平均停留 ≈ 98 ns，視場中央速度為平均的 π/2 倍，停留 ≈ 62 ns，在 80 MHz 下只有約 5 個脈衝；若改用 4 MHz 雷射則每像素僅 0.25 個脈衝，共振掃描不可行。","textEn":"Resonant 8 kHz with bidirectional lines: 512 lines take 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms, about 31 Hz frame rate. Of each 62.5 µs half period about 50 µs is usable, so 512 pixels dwell ≈ 98 ns on average; at the field centre the velocity is π/2 times the mean, dwell ≈ 62 ns, only about 5 pulses at 80 MHz; with a 4 MHz laser only 0.25 pulses per pixel would land, so resonant scanning would be unusable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scan timing, power gating and system integration\", which statement holds?","options":["只要功率夠大，雙光子就能成像到任意深度。","偵測器放在哪裡都一樣，只要擋掉雷射就好。","8 kHz 共振、雙向取線：512 條線需 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms，幀率約 31 Hz。"],"optionsEn":["With enough power two-photon imaging reaches any depth.","Detector placement does not matter as long as the laser is blocked.","Resonant 8 kHz with bidirectional lines: 512 lines take 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms, about 31 Hz frame rate."],"answer":2,"explanation":"8 kHz 共振、雙向取線：512 條線需 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms，幀率約 31 Hz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Resonant 8 kHz with bidirectional lines: 512 lines take 512/16,000 ≈ 32 ms, about 31 Hz frame rate. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a427-v12-27","title":"掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scan timing, power gating and system integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「共振掃描器與像素時脈」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Resonant scanner and pixel clock” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用示波器同時觀察共振掃描器的相位回授、像素時脈與 Pockels 閘控訊號，確認閘控在回程期間關閉且像素時脈隨正弦速度變化；以格線標板影像檢查邊緣與中央的比例尺是否一致，偏差超過 1% 時重新校正像素時脈。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Observe the resonant scanner phase feedback, pixel clock and Pockels gating together on an oscilloscope, confirming that gating closes during fly-back and the pixel clock follows the sinusoidal velocity; check with a grid-target image that scale at the edges matches the centre and recalibrate the pixel clock if the deviation exceeds 1%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：共振掃描器相位回授與像素時脈錯位半個像素，雙向取線的奇偶列彼此錯開，影像出現梳狀條紋，細胞輪廓被撕裂。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A half-pixel misalignment between the resonant scanner phase feedback and the pixel clock offsets the odd and even bidirectional lines, producing comb-like striping that tears cell outlines apart.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用示波器同時觀察共振掃描器的相位回授、像素時脈與 Pockels 閘控訊號，確認閘控在回程期間關閉且像素時脈隨正弦速度變化；以格線標板影像檢查邊緣與中央的比例尺是否一致，偏差超過 1% 時重新校正像素時脈。","textEn":"Observe the resonant scanner phase feedback, pixel clock and Pockels gating together on an oscilloscope, confirming that gating closes during fly-back and the pixel clock follows the sinusoidal velocity; check with a grid-target image that scale at the edges matches the centre and recalibrate the pixel clock if the deviation exceeds 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scan timing, power gating and system integration\"?","options":["用示波器同時觀察共振掃描器的相位回授、像素時脈與 Pockels 閘控訊號，確認閘控在回程期間關閉且像素時脈隨正弦速度變化。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。"],"optionsEn":["Observe the resonant scanner phase feedback, pixel clock and Pockels gating together on an oscilloscope, confirming that gating closes during fly-back and the pixel clock follows the sinusoidal velocity.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用示波器同時觀察共振掃描器的相位回授、像素時脈與 Pockels 閘控訊號，確認閘控在回程期間關閉且像素時脈隨正弦速度變化；以格線標板影像檢查邊緣與中央的比例尺是否一致，偏差超過 1% 時重新校正像素時脈。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Observe the resonant scanner phase feedback, pixel clock and Pockels gating together on an oscilloscope, confirming that gating closes during fly-back and the pixel clock follows the sinusoidal velocity; check with a grid-target image that scale at the edges matches the centre and recalibrate the pixel clock if the deviation exceeds 1%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a427-v12-28","title":"掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scan timing, power gating and system integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「共振掃描器與像素時脈」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Resonant scanner and pixel clock” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"共振掃描器相位回授與像素時脈錯位半個像素，雙向取線的奇偶列彼此錯開，影像出現梳狀條紋，細胞輪廓被撕裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A half-pixel misalignment between the resonant scanner phase feedback and the pixel clock offsets the odd and even bidirectional lines, producing comb-like striping that tears cell outlines apart. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：Pockels 盒在回程與視場外閘控雷射以減少劑量；正弦速度不均需以像素時脈補償，否則視場邊緣被拉伸。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The Pockels cell gates the laser during fly-back and outside the field to cut dose, and the nonuniform sinusoidal velocity must be corrected with the pixel clock or the field edges stretch.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「共振掃描器越快，影像品質就越好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A faster resonant scanner always gives better image quality.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"共振掃描器相位回授與像素時脈錯位半個像素，雙向取線的奇偶列彼此錯開，影像出現梳狀條紋，細胞輪廓被撕裂。","textEn":"A half-pixel misalignment between the resonant scanner phase feedback and the pixel clock offsets the odd and even bidirectional lines, producing comb-like striping that tears cell outlines apart.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「掃描時序、功率閘控與系統整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scan timing, power gating and system integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","共振掃描器相位回授與像素時脈錯位半個像素，雙向取線的奇偶列彼此錯開，影像出現梳狀條紋，細胞輪廓被撕裂。","表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A half-pixel misalignment between the resonant scanner phase feedback and the pixel clock offsets the odd and even bidirectional lines, producing comb-like striping that tears cell outlines apart.","A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth."],"answer":1,"explanation":"共振掃描器相位回授與像素時脈錯位半個像素，雙向取線的奇偶列彼此錯開，影像出現梳狀條紋，細胞輪廓被撕裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A half-pixel misalignment between the resonant scanner phase feedback and the pixel clock offsets the odd and even bidirectional lines, producing comb-like striping that tears cell outlines apart. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a427-v12-29","title":"系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「散射假體驗收與交接文件」如何決定雙光子顯微鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record” determines the key performance of “Two-photon microscopy”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"驗收要同時在表面與深處證明性能：表面用螢光珠量點擴散函數，深處用含脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體在 300 µm 處再量一次，判斷散射與球差的退化；用螢光素溶液確認功率平方律與脈衝最短點；用功率計與自相關儀記錄每條波長的樣品面功率與脈衝寬度。交接文件包含 Pockels 對照表、預補償設定對物鏡與波長的表格、各偵測器的 F 值與允收結果，並註明熱安全的平均功率上限。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「散射假體驗收與交接文件」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Acceptance must prove performance at the surface and at depth: beads at the surface for the point-spread function, a lipid-emulsion agarose phantom at 300 µm for a second measurement that reveals scattering and spherical-aberration degradation; fluorescein solution to confirm the power square law and the shortest-pulse setting; and a power meter plus autocorrelator to log sample-plane power and pulse width at each wavelength. The handoff record holds the Pockels lookup table, the precompensation setting per objective and wavelength, each detector's F value and the acceptance results, and states the thermally safe average-power ceiling. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：允收門檻範例：表面橫向半高寬 ≤ 0.45 µm、軸向 ≤ 1.7 µm（各為理論 0.35 與 1.27 µm 的 1.3 倍）；300 µm 深處半高寬 ≤ 表面值的 1.5 倍；樣品面脈衝 ≤ 120 fs；功率平方律斜率 2.0 ± 0.1；視場邊緣對中央照度 ≥ 0.8；平均功率上限 150 mW（估計溫升 2.7 K）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Example thresholds: surface lateral FWHM ≤ 0.45 µm and axial ≤ 1.7 µm (1.3 times the theoretical 0.35 and 1.27 µm); FWHM at 300 µm depth ≤ 1.5 times the surface value; sample-plane pulse ≤ 120 fs; square-law slope 2.0 ± 0.1; edge-to-centre illumination ≥ 0.8; average-power ceiling 150 mW (estimated 2.7 K rise).","failure":"常見誤解：「表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「散射假體驗收與交接文件」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-29-k1","title":"系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接","titleEn":"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff","text":"驗收要同時在表面與深處證明性能：表面用螢光珠量點擴散函數，深處用含脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體在 300 µm 處再量一次，判斷散射與球差的退化；用螢光素溶液確認功率平方律與脈衝最短點；用功率計與自相關儀記錄每條波長的樣品面功率與脈衝寬度。交接文件包含 Pockels 對照表、預補償設定對物鏡與波長的表格、各偵測器的 F 值與允收結果，並註明熱安全的平均功率上限。","textEn":"Acceptance must prove performance at the surface and at depth: beads at the surface for the point-spread function, a lipid-emulsion agarose phantom at 300 µm for a second measurement that reveals scattering and spherical-aberration degradation; fluorescein solution to confirm the power square law and the shortest-pulse setting; and a power meter plus autocorrelator to log sample-plane power and pulse width at each wavelength. The handoff record holds the Pockels lookup table, the precompensation setting per objective and wavelength, each detector's F value and the acceptance results, and states the thermally safe average-power ceiling.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。","雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","驗收要同時在表面與深處證明性能：表面用螢光珠量點擴散函數，深處用含脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體在 300 µm 處再量一次，判斷散射與球差的退化。"],"optionsEn":["A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth.","A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","Acceptance must prove performance at the surface and at depth: beads at the surface for the point-spread function, a lipid-emulsion agarose phantom at 300 µm for a second measurement that reveals scattering and spherical-aberration degradation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"驗收要同時在表面與深處證明性能：表面用螢光珠量點擴散函數，深處用含脂肪乳劑的瓊脂假體在 300 µm 處再量一次，判斷散射與球差的退化；用螢光素溶液確認功率平方律與脈衝最短點；用功率計與自相關儀記錄每條波長的樣品面功率與脈衝寬度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Acceptance must prove performance at the surface and at depth: beads at the surface for the point-spread function, a lipid-emulsion agarose phantom at 300 µm for a second measurement that reveals scattering and spherical-aberration degradation; fluorescein solution to confirm the power square law and the shortest-pulse setting; and a power meter plus autocorrelator to log sample-plane power and pulse width at each wavelength. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a427-v12-30","title":"系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「散射假體驗收與交接文件」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：允收門檻範例：表面橫向半高寬 ≤ 0.45 µm、軸向 ≤ 1.7 µm（各為理論 0.35 與 1.27 µm 的 1.3 倍）；300 µm 深處半高寬 ≤ 表面值的 1.5 倍；樣品面脈衝 ≤ 120 fs；功率平方律斜率 2.0 ± 0.1；視場邊緣對中央照度 ≥ 0.8；平均功率上限 150 mW（估計溫升 2.7 K）。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Example thresholds: surface lateral FWHM ≤ 0.45 µm and axial ≤ 1.7 µm (1.3 times the theoretical 0.35 and 1.27 µm); FWHM at 300 µm depth ≤ 1.5 times the surface value; sample-plane pulse ≤ 120 fs; square-law slope 2.0 ± 0.1; edge-to-centre illumination ≥ 0.8; average-power ceiling 150 mW (estimated 2.7 K rise). Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依清單逐項量測並記錄通過與否；深度測試用同一批假體與珠子以便跨系統比較；完成後把原始珠子疊層、功率序列與自相關曲線連同設定檔一起歸檔，供日後趨勢比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure each list item and record pass or fail; use the same phantom and bead batch for depth tests so systems can be compared; archive the raw bead stacks, power series and autocorrelation traces together with the configuration files for later trend comparison.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"允收門檻範例：表面橫向半高寬 ≤ 0.45 µm、軸向 ≤ 1.7 µm（各為理論 0.35 與 1.27 µm 的 1.3 倍）；300 µm 深處半高寬 ≤ 表面值的 1.5 倍；樣品面脈衝 ≤ 120 fs；功率平方律斜率 2.0 ± 0.1；視場邊緣對中央照度 ≥ 0.8；平均功率上限 150 mW（估計溫升 2.7 K）。","textEn":"Example thresholds: surface lateral FWHM ≤ 0.45 µm and axial ≤ 1.7 µm (1.3 times the theoretical 0.35 and 1.27 µm); FWHM at 300 µm depth ≤ 1.5 times the surface value; sample-plane pulse ≤ 120 fs; square-law slope 2.0 ± 0.1; edge-to-centre illumination ≥ 0.8; average-power ceiling 150 mW (estimated 2.7 K rise).","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["允收門檻範例：表面橫向半高寬 ≤ 0.45 µm、軸向 ≤ 1.7 µm（各為理論 0.35 與 1.27 µm 的 1.3 倍）。","雷射規格書上的脈衝寬度就是樣品處的脈衝寬度。","功率計放在雷射出口量到的值可以直接當作樣品面的功率。"],"optionsEn":["Example thresholds: surface lateral FWHM ≤ 0.45 µm and axial ≤ 1.7 µm (1.3 times the theoretical 0.35 and 1.27 µm).","The pulse width in the laser datasheet is the pulse width at the sample.","Power measured at the laser output can be used directly as power at the sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"允收門檻範例：表面橫向半高寬 ≤ 0.45 µm、軸向 ≤ 1.7 µm（各為理論 0.35 與 1.27 µm 的 1.3 倍）；300 µm 深處半高寬 ≤ 表面值的 1.5 倍；樣品面脈衝 ≤ 120 fs；功率平方律斜率 2.0 ± 0.1；視場邊緣對中央照度 ≥ 0.8；平均功率上限 150 mW（估計溫升 2.7 K）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Example thresholds: surface lateral FWHM ≤ 0.45 µm and axial ≤ 1.7 µm (1.3 times the theoretical 0.35 and 1.27 µm); FWHM at 300 µm depth ≤ 1.5 times the surface value; sample-plane pulse ≤ 120 fs; square-law slope 2.0 ± 0.1; edge-to-centre illumination ≥ 0.8; average-power ceiling 150 mW (estimated 2.7 K rise). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a427-v12-31","title":"系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「散射假體驗收與交接文件」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依清單逐項量測並記錄通過與否；深度測試用同一批假體與珠子以便跨系統比較；完成後把原始珠子疊層、功率序列與自相關曲線連同設定檔一起歸檔，供日後趨勢比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure each list item and record pass or fail; use the same phantom and bead batch for depth tests so systems can be compared; archive the raw bead stacks, power series and autocorrelation traces together with the configuration files for later trend comparison. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：驗收只在蓋玻片表面測珠子而不做深度假體，交付後在 300 µm 深處才發現球差使軸向半高寬達 4 µm，問題來自物鏡校正環未依深度設定，卻已無基準可追溯。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting on surface beads alone without a depth phantom leaves spherical aberration undiscovered until a 4 µm axial FWHM appears at 300 µm after delivery, caused by an objective correction collar not set for depth, with no baseline left to trace it.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依清單逐項量測並記錄通過與否；深度測試用同一批假體與珠子以便跨系統比較；完成後把原始珠子疊層、功率序列與自相關曲線連同設定檔一起歸檔，供日後趨勢比對。","textEn":"Measure each list item and record pass or fail; use the same phantom and bead batch for depth tests so systems can be compared; archive the raw bead stacks, power series and autocorrelation traces together with the configuration files for later trend comparison.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","依清單逐項量測並記錄通過與否；深度測試用同一批假體與珠子以便跨系統比較；完成後把原始珠子疊層、功率序列與自相關曲線連同設定檔一起歸檔，供日後趨勢比對。","提高光電倍增管增益可以提高影像的信噪比。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure each list item and record pass or fail.","Raising photomultiplier gain improves the image signal-to-noise ratio."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依清單逐項量測並記錄通過與否；深度測試用同一批假體與珠子以便跨系統比較；完成後把原始珠子疊層、功率序列與自相關曲線連同設定檔一起歸檔，供日後趨勢比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure each list item and record pass or fail; use the same phantom and bead batch for depth tests so systems can be compared; archive the raw bead stacks, power series and autocorrelation traces together with the configuration files for later trend comparison. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a427-v12-32","title":"系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"prerequisiteIds":["a427-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「散射假體驗收與交接文件」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Scattering-phantom acceptance and handoff record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"驗收只在蓋玻片表面測珠子而不做深度假體，交付後在 300 µm 深處才發現球差使軸向半高寬達 4 µm，問題來自物鏡校正環未依深度設定，卻已無基準可追溯。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Accepting on surface beads alone without a depth phantom leaves spherical aberration undiscovered until a 4 µm axial FWHM appears at 300 µm after delivery, caused by an objective correction collar not set for depth, with no baseline left to trace it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件包含 Pockels 對照表、預補償設定對物鏡與波長的表格、各偵測器的 F 值與允收結果，並註明熱安全的平均功率上限。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record holds the Pockels lookup table, the precompensation setting per objective and wavelength, each detector's F value and the acceptance results, and states the thermally safe average-power ceiling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「表面的點擴散函數合格，深層成像品質就有保證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A good surface point-spread function guarantees image quality at depth.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a427-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"驗收只在蓋玻片表面測珠子而不做深度假體，交付後在 300 µm 深處才發現球差使軸向半高寬達 4 µm，問題來自物鏡校正環未依深度設定，卻已無基準可追溯。","textEn":"Accepting on surface beads alone without a depth phantom leaves spherical aberration undiscovered until a 4 µm axial FWHM appears at 300 µm after delivery, caused by an objective correction collar not set for depth, with no baseline left to trace it.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]},{"id":"a427-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「系統驗證、散射假體與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System validation, scattering phantom and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","雙光子顯微鏡需要針孔才能得到光學切片。","驗收只在蓋玻片表面測珠子而不做深度假體，交付後在 300 µm 深處才發現球差使軸向半高寬達 4 µm，問題來自物鏡校正環未依深度設定，卻已無基準可追溯。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A two-photon microscope needs a pinhole to obtain optical sections.","Accepting on surface beads alone without a depth phantom leaves spherical aberration undiscovered until a 4 µm axial FWHM appears at 300 µm after delivery, caused by an objective correction collar not set for depth, with no baseline left to trace it."],"answer":2,"explanation":"驗收只在蓋玻片表面測珠子而不做深度假體，交付後在 300 µm 深處才發現球差使軸向半高寬達 4 µm，問題來自物鏡校正環未依深度設定，卻已無基準可追溯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting on surface beads alone without a depth phantom leaves spherical aberration undiscovered until a 4 µm axial FWHM appears at 300 µm after delivery, caused by an objective correction collar not set for depth, with no baseline left to trace it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-microscopyu-multiphoton","v12o-janelia-mimms","v12o-bruker-multiphoton"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
